&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;A world-leading rapid-growth digital asset trading firm is looking for a systematic trader to manage quantitative trading strategies and help improve the in-house trading and risk management platform. The firm has presence in major cryptocurrency exchanges and it trades different kinds of products in the market, ranging from spot to structural products. The firm is highly tech-driven with people from top-tier investment banks, hedge funds, and tech companies.&lt;/div&gt;
